---
import InnerLayout from "../../layouts/InnerLayout.astro";
import LinkBox from "../../components/ITserviceLinkBox.astro";
---

<InnerLayout>
  <section class="it-services-all">
    <div class="container">
      <LinkBox />
      <div class="text-container">
        <h3>CYBER SECURITY</h3>
        <h4>CYBER SECURITY for Small and Medium-Sized Business</h4>
        <p>
          Sixty-one percent of data breaches happen to companies with fewer than
          1,000 employees. The financial impact of a data breach can cripple
          your company’s ability to operate. Data loss could lead to extended
          downtime when you can’t serve your customers and you may lose their
          trust in your business.
        </p>
        <p>
          Technical security is about protecting your network from intruders.
          Technical security uses tools such as next-generation firewalls and
          antivirus software to limit unauthorized access to your network, as
          well as detect and remove malware.
        </p>
        <p>
          No one company can fulfill all your business’s cyber security needs,
          but BIM can help you build a foundation for a strong cyber security
          policy.
        </p>
        <p>
          We will secure your network and advise your company’s C-suite of best
          security practices. We will regularly monitor your network for threats
          and maintain compliance standards. We may also implement standard
          policies such as multiple security technology and identity management.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/contact">CONTACT US</a>TODAY TO DISCUSS CYBER SECURITY?
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="img-container">
        <img src="/images/icons/technology.jpg" alt="" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</InnerLayout>
